    <description>PPIA Agentforce Action 3 — Wrapper flow that calls the PPIA_QueryCareEpisodes Apex invocable. Queries all care episodes for a list of patient Account IDs and returns aggregated metrics: total episodes, T12M, billed, received, collection rate, PA approval rate, denial rate, top procedure, top disease state. Call this THIRD after PPIA_Get_Member_Plans using out_patient_account_ids_csv.</description>
